@startuml
hide footbox
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName Microsoft YaHei
skinparam defaultFontSize 18
skinparam sequenceParticipantFontSize 18
skinparam sequenceMessageFontSize 17
skinparam sequenceArrowThickness 1.5
skinparam sequenceGroupFontSize 17
skinparam ParticipantPadding 28
skinparam BoxPadding 12
skinparam ArrowColor #31546F
skinparam LifeLineBorderColor #7A91A5
skinparam ParticipantBorderColor #287A78
skinparam ParticipantBackgroundColor #EAF7F6
skinparam ActorBorderColor #287A78
skinparam ActorBackgroundColor #FFFFFF
autonumber

actor 用户 as User
boundary "阅读与问答界面" as UI
control "问答编排器" as QA
control "权限校验" as Gate
control "检索服务" as Retrieval
control "模型网关" as Model
control "引用核验器" as Verifier

User -> UI : 提交问题并选择选区、章节或全文
UI -> QA : 提交问题与文档范围
QA -> Gate : 过滤无权访问的文档版本
Gate --> QA : 返回授权范围
QA -> Retrieval : 检索证据并保留页码与段落定位
Retrieval --> QA : 返回Evidence允许列表

alt 没有足够证据
  QA --> UI : 返回无依据拒答
else 证据满足阈值
  QA -> Model : 仅携带允许证据生成结构化回答
  Model --> QA : 返回Answer、Claim与Citation
  QA -> Verifier : 校验每条引用的页码、摘录与定位
  Verifier --> QA : 返回有效引用与需复核项
  QA --> UI : 展示回答、引用徽章和原文回跳
end
UI --> User : 点击引用后高亮对应原文
@enduml
